[profiles.guide]
notes = '''Hold {select} and {start} together to pause the gyro while you reposition the controller. Tilting the controller moves the cursor, as a fine pointer next to the right stick {rs}.
The right stick {rs} moves the pointer and the left stick {ls} moves the camera. {rt} or {south} clicks, {lt} right-clicks to delete what's under the pointer.
Hold {lb} for the build tools, aiming with the right stick {rs}. Tap {rb} for the next speed: fast, fastest, then normal again. Press {rb} with the {dpad} for one speed (left is normal, up fast, right fastest, and down pauses); hold {rb} to see them.
{west} rotates what you're placing; hold it to pick up the look of an object already placed. Hold {north} and move the pointer to change height.
Hold {l3} to snap to the grid and {r3} to snap to height while you place.
{up} and {down} zoom, and holding them grows or shrinks the object. {left} and {right} turn the camera.
{select} lists the map view, the X-ray toggles and the screenshot. Double tap {start} to quick save.
Naming a ride or a park: {guide} + {west} opens the on-screen keyboard.'''

